<div class="section_content content" id="7679011_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The article shall be known as "Local Law No. 2 of 1940" and is intended to change and supersede Subdivision 5 of Sections 1, 4 and 5 of Chapter 285 of the Laws of 1914, as amended by Chapter 677 of the Laws of 1926, as amended by Local Law No. 5 of the year 1936, and to add two new sections thereto numbered 15 and 16.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

